 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Dragon Vein — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>At 3rd level, as a bonus action for 3 CE while your feet are touching the ground, you form a Ley Line connection for 1 minute. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You are immune to magical effects that would forcefully move or teleport you.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You reduce all damage taken by your proficiency bonus.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>As a reaction to taking damage, you can spend 1 CE reinforce your body with cursed energy and gain resistance to the triggering damage type until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You lose these benefits while your feet are not touching the ground. At 11th level, you are immune to being grappled, restrained, or knocked prone while your Ley Line is active.  </p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
